    in December 2025 of 1 share for every 5 shares issued, in January 26, 2026 of 1 share for every 3 shares issued, in March 2026 of
    1 share for every 4 shares issued, and in July 2026 of 1 share for every 3 shares issued respectively.</span></td></tr>
