</div><div style="padding-right: 5.4pt; padding-left: 5.4pt; border: Black 1.5pt solid">

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: center"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><img alt="" src="ea030132501_img14.jpg" style="width: 670px; height: 398px"/>&#160;&#160;</span></p>

</div><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p><div>

