issued, in August 2025 of 1 share for every 5 shares issued, in December 2025 of 1 share for every 5 shares issued, in January 26, 2026
of 1 share for every 3 shares issued, in March 2026 of 1 share for every 4 shares issued and in July 2026 of 1 share for every 3 shares
issued respectively.</p>
                                                                                                                                                   <p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&#160;</p>
                                                                                                                                                   <p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">Proforma adjustment is made to reflect that the Company made an unrealized
gain of $3,000,000 in the 2% equity investment in PredicXion and realized a loss of $4,008,103 with the Amendment and Exchange Agreement
