</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">The following table sets
forth a breakdown of NewGenIvf&#8217;s revenue by the types of services, in absolute amounts and as percentages of total revenue, for
the periods indicated.</p><div>

