</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">To increase the scale of NewGenIvf&#8217;s operations, NewGenIvf expanded
its Thailand fertility services by leasing a new property for its second clinic Erawan Consultation Clinic in May&#160;2023. Consisting
of approximately 2,615 sq. ft., Erawan Consultation Clinic was open in June 2025 and closed in April 2026.</p><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">&#160;</p><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">Currently, IVF treatments
