</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&#160;</p><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">During the year ended December 31, 2024, no cash was exchanged in respect
of these transactions:</p><div>

